{"c":[{"name":"20261021T174235Z-774be06df86dea8f","text":"stockroom doctor rule (operator, 2026-10-21): any discoverable doctor command (probe, smoke) never writes. Every doctor write sits behind 'stockroom doctor fix <name>' and runs only when named. First fix planned: 'doctor fix hnsw-wal' for the DuckDB 2.0.0 HNSW replay bug.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T175900Z-bd6ed7dba4d68c72","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 replay bug goes silent: other writers succeed, the wal grows, and past checkpoint_threshold (16 MiB) the auto-checkpoint folds it. Then the HNSW index silently lacks the replayed rows (pragma_hnsw_index_info count < count(*)); top-k skips them. A rebuild fixes it.","type":"note"}]}
